        "slc_e00c95a84782381ef4f50d3870190b7bdfefb8af5038d9db55b0f7d1563ec705"
      ],
      "text": "Desktop sections are saved local conversation threads per workspace that preserve history, active model, profile, thinking mode, plan state, and session state when available."
    },
