        "slc_fc1f4876fa5dccbf42c014907adcc73ede0ace4ca679cd149a548b984f6018fb"
      ],
      "text": "Built-in tracked edit tools include `file_write`, `apply_patch`, `insert_content`, and `search_and_replace`, which record before/after state and participate in `/undo`, `/redo`, and edit summaries."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_65681661242f27f44d30df6e5eccdbe69e23ebda9676a62bce250c5c465bdca5",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "dfe4dd78998824cb61ad508e07050c4ab884e7e6",
          "git_sha": "d1b73a0e4a393c8914adf33fe1afcad69a463aed",
          "line_end": 87,
          "line_start": 87,
          "path": "docs/documentation.md",
          "repository": "rizwan3d/stemcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/rizwan3d/StemCode/blob/dfe4dd78998824cb61ad508e07050c4ab884e7e6/docs/documentation.md#L87-L87"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_545ffb912688393b2c2a1ebcc1d6408a18b73220442464189693f044ea9c0512"
      ],
      "text": "The npm `stemcode` package is a thin installer that downloads the matching release binary and verifies it against published SHA256SUMS, with no .NET toolchain required; targets include win-x64, osx-x64, osx-arm64, linux-x64, and linux-arm64."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_598591c31020e723ccfe711ca433001074cfef4c3f9841053120198bc15a26e8",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "dfe4dd78998824cb61ad508e07050c4ab884e7e6",
          "git_sha": "d1b73a0e4a393c8914adf33fe1afcad69a463aed",
          "line_end": 169,
          "line_start": 152,
          "path": "docs/documentation.md",
          "repository": "rizwan3d/stemcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/rizwan3d/StemCode/blob/dfe4dd78998824cb61ad508e07050c4ab884e7e6/docs/documentation.md#L152-L169"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b3f357ed82b0444d3d42b987eb68da02b830c7346e4c745bed6dd919f7ea383d"
      ],
      "text": "Providers span subscription sign-in (ChatGPT Plus/Pro, Claude Pro/Max, GitHub Copilot), API-key providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenRouter, Groq, DeepSeek, and others), OpenAI-compatible endpoints, and local providers such as Ollama."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_eee98137ca9d49a20d6d4e07890519935a319aac12d3a7e9c7b574fbe8889c59",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "dfe4dd78998824cb61ad508e07050c4ab884e7e6",
          "git_sha": "d1b73a0e4a393c8914adf33fe1afcad69a463aed",
          "line_end": 212,
          "line_start": 212,
          "path": "docs/documentation.md",
          "repository": "rizwan3d/stemcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/rizwan3d/StemCode/blob/dfe4dd78998824cb61ad508e07050c4ab884e7e6/docs/documentation.md#L212-L212"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_99be81e9dd89e0b87650fb9f3322c33a96f2406b61b5a2097e132f30cb54c7c6"
      ],
      "text": "Budget controls are disabled by default and activate only via `/budget local`, `/budget cloud`, or an existing `.stemcode/budget-controls.*.json` file; while disabled, no usage is recorded and provider requests are never blocked."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c1032f0da4048c2d00d8e56ec33f93fb4488855e37ab4e527038043f5362a6d8",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "dfe4dd78998824cb61ad508e07050c4ab884e7e6",
          "git_sha": "5d1a420a7e8f545dd71f6e81660c74dfe6a30808",
          "line_end": 90,
          "line_start": 81,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rizwan3d/stemcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/rizwan3d/StemCode/blob/dfe4dd78998824cb61ad508e07050c4ab884e7e6/README.md#L81-L90"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_adbd7470b16e876623214bf9368c1a5f58f3a82469f7c21b25550d9d24d94ee5"
      ],
      "text": "Subagents run delegated tasks with independent contexts to keep the main conversation focused, and interactive user questions support clarification, multiple-choice, multi-select, and free-form input."
    },
